{"data": [{"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-06T02:23:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118529716273434644"], "id": "2118529716273434644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 34972, "like_count": 303, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 41, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "When the Nasdaq sneezes...\nThe South Korean and Japanese stock markets tumble 6% in the wake of the US selloff.\n#markets #stocks #japan #korea #investing #investors", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2118529716273434644"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:49:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118521058315944150"], "id": "2118521058315944150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2567, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Who called it a lovely bookcase and not shelf-recommending", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2118521058315944150"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118516342475432264"], "id": "2118516342475432264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2624, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Two Zitrons don’t make a right", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2118516342475432264"}, {"author_id": "825088493764407298", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:24:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118514586223816789", "2118514804189233568"], "id": "2118514804189233568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1185, "impression_count": 212328, "like_count": 2447, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 73, "retweet_count": 61}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118449808402681911", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Honestly quite impressed with the methodology on this benchmark. @dwarkesh_sp want a job designing evals at @OpenAI? https://t.co/cnfu0gcNtu https://t.co/K7l9PZFvLP", "url": "https://x.com/polynoamial/status/2118514804189233568"}, {"author_id": "825088493764407298", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:23:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118514586223816789", "2118514804189233568"], "id": "2118514586223816789", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2217, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118449808402681911", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Honestly quite impressed with the methodology on this benchmark. @dwarkesh_sp want a job designing evals at @OpenAI? https://t.co/K7l9PZFvLP", "url": "https://x.com/polynoamial/status/2118514586223816789"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:13:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497026329518238"], "id": "2118497026329518238", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 61, "impression_count": 40993, "like_count": 881, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 153, "retweet_count": 51}, "text": "As I have written many times in the past years, any potential financial downturn in AI stocks will not greatly change the AI trajectory\n\nAI is not going away, companies are not slowing down adoption nor is development slowing. We still need policy &amp; effort so that AI is used well", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2118497026329518238"}, {"author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:45:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118490001885303211"], "id": "2118490001885303211", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2964, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Compensation costs up 2.3 percent in New England, 4.3 percent in Pacific region, over year ended September 2026 https://t.co/AwXmKjb2TV #BLSdata https://t.co/Z6j8EpH7St", "url": "https://x.com/BLS_gov/status/2118490001885303211"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:23:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118484445120672061"], "id": "2118484445120672061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3433, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118395730549522867", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "They call her CLAUDia Sheinbaum for a reason https://t.co/uGFwd0KY2N", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2118484445120672061"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:03:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118479462551392432"], "id": "2118479462551392432", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 50862, "like_count": 389, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 50, "retweet_count": 35}, "text": "America’s \"let it rip\" approach to AI aligns with the technology's productivity potential and national security imperatives. \nHowever, it has fallen short not only on safety and diffusion, but also on bringing society along.\nThe resulting backlash evident in the midterms was", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2118479462551392432"}, {"author_id": "25098482", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:30:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118470947862904977"], "id": "2118470947862904977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 18822, "like_count": 62, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "Asia accounts for two-thirds of global growth, but sustaining that success will require a new playbook,  IMF’s Krishna Srinivasan writes in F&amp;D magazine. https://t.co/qYCjIr1Ttu https://t.co/WpSTDrCsci", "url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2118470947862904977"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:11:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118466236094759237"], "id": "2118466236094759237", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 16543, "like_count": 79, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "I think its technically five billionaire-funded magazines, though I believe all have editorial independence: the City Journal (Paul Singer's Foundation), Baffler (Soros Open Society), Poetry (Ruth Lily Endowment), Noema (Berggruen Institute) and Works in Progress (Stripe). https://t.co/eAI1lnWmIl", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2118466236094759237"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:01:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118463680295944665"], "id": "2118463680295944665", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 294, "impression_count": 54502, "like_count": 765, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 53, "retweet_count": 57}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118349705906127021", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Erik is one of the economists who has been watching the impact of AI on the economy most closely, even before generative AI... https://t.co/VCoOfWi4mg", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2118463680295944665"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:29:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118455743833866462"], "id": "2118455743833866462", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 13307, "like_count": 200, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Waymo has gone downhill a ton in the past few months due to riders doing shit like smoking/messing with the equipment \n\nWaymo should probably be stopping things like this in the act, eg pull over and kick someone out for smoking. Lots of ways to do that while preserving privacy", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2118455743833866462"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "332617373", "name": "Mohamed A. El-Erian", "username": "elerianm"}, {"id": "1214528593", "name": "Miles Brundage", "username": "Miles_Brundage"}, {"id": "825088493764407298", "name": "Noam Brown", "username": "polynoamial"}, {"id": "39125788", "name": "Ethan Mollick", "username": "emollick"}, {"id": "612896910", "name": "BLS-Labor Statistics", "username": "BLS_gov"}, {"id": "25098482", "name": "IMF", "username": "IMFNews"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118529716273434644", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj846ufpwaxpejlrq3t